      "message": "Needed for the SSE benefit (important)\n\nThe design relies on SSE → Vue Query invalidation as a key benefit, but it never defines the Vue Query \"key\" convention. Without a required key (based on the @odata.id), two screens fetching the same resource can create two separate cache entries — which is the exact duplicate-cache problem this design criticizes Vuex for.\n\nPlease specify the mandatory query-key scheme keyed on @odata.id. This is a prerequisite for SSE working at all.",
